---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<BaseLayout title="About">
<section class="section"><div class="container">
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="photo-frame photo-frame-v54 reveal"><img src={`${base}/images/avery-moon.jpg`} alt="Portrait of Avery Moon" /></div>
    <div class="about-copy reveal">
      <div class="about-title-block">
        <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
        <h1>Hi, I'm Avery.</h1>
      </div>
      <p class="lead">I help organizations work smarter by improving the systems people rely on every day.</p>
      <p>My background spans operations leadership, knowledge management, systems improvement, and cross-functional projects across manufacturing, technology, education, and community-focused organizations.</p>
      <p>I've spent much of my career simplifying complex workflows and building practical tools that help people work more effectively. From materials forecasting and workforce planning to training programs and knowledge-sharing systems, I'm drawn to making information easier to access, understand, and use.</p>
      <p>More recently, I've been expanding into AI-assisted development, product design, and geospatial analysis, exploring how these tools can support better decisions and solve problems beyond traditional business operations.</p>
      <p>My current interests include climate adaptation, conservation, natural resources and resource management, and environmental intelligence. Through coursework and independent projects, I'm developing ways to apply my experience in systems design and operations to ecological monitoring, sustainable resource allocation, and climate resilience.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href={`${base}/built-systems/`}>Explore My Work</a><a class="button" href={`${base}/research-writing/`}>Research & Writing</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="exploring reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow">Current Focus</div>
    <div class="exploring-list">
      <span>AI-Assisted Tools</span><span>Knowledge Management</span><span>Product Development</span><span>GIS &amp; Spatial Analysis</span><span>Climate Adaptation</span><span>Conservation &amp; Natural Resource Management</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="optimize-strip reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow">What Guides My Work</div>
    <div class="optimize-values"><span>Curiosity</span><span>Practicality</span><span>Accessibility</span><span>Stewardship</span></div>
  </div>
</div></section>
</BaseLayout>
